# p-drag-quantized (h11-p-drag): a press on P's centre (the grab is p −
# point.x = 0) and a 3 px move: p = 2.06 exactly (the drag writes
# quantize(point.x + grab), the quantum 0.01). The release flushes the url
# at once: p=2.06.
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# the held shot cursor grab-active, the p line 2.06, the url line p=2.06;
# after the release cursor grab-hover (the pointer is still on P), the p
# line 2.06.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1028 290
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1031 290
wait 300
shot p-drag-quantized-held
up
wait 600
shot p-drag-quantized
